"Some monsters are souls reborn from a world called Earth; they have the System early or at birth."
"The reborn see the System as game screens, and cannot read this world's script."
"Renir can apply the System to a beast; doing so once drained him into long dormancy."
"Renir tells people he installed the System in clever monsters, to hide their Earth origin."
"Renir suspects the System is the joint work of several unknown makers, judging by its naming."
"A strong will can bully the System into granting things, even an Inventory to a monster."
